# symbolic SATO template
# family: F&D Private Label (label-type-code=4) / 1.75x8.38 / manual (operator-triggered)
# ported field-for-field from c:\Workspace\southalr\dtplb006.i, dispatched from
# dtlbl062.p:777-789 (conditional on printer model matching 85R/86R, else dtplb005.i) /
# dtlbl072.p:716-718 when ih-label-type-code=04.
#
# Genuinely a 2-up print (two full copies side by side, H830.../H820... first copy,
# H480.../H470... second copy), same as the 2x7.25 manual variant. Source's model gate only
# supports M-8400RV/84VL -- skipped for the same reason as the other manual sizes (see
# lt04_default_2x725_man.sato's header). No trailing "~033Q~033Z~003" of its own -- relies on
# the calling program's shared post-dispatch finalization, folded in directly as {Quantity}
# same as the 2x7.25 manual variant.

